Package: whisper-gui-bg
Version: 1.0.1-1
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: LZ5PN <lz5pn@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-tk, ffmpeg, python3-venv, python3-pip, git, cmake, build-essential, curl, ca-certificates
Description: Offline video transcription and Bulgarian SRT translation GUI
 Tkinter frontend for whisper.cpp and Argos Translate.
 Run whisper-gui-setup to install CPU-only engines and models.
